<h3><u>Ghareeb e karbala</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haaye, haaye<br />
hussain, hussain<br />
mazloom hussain<br />
Hussain</p>

<p>O the son of Mohammad(pbuh)<br />
O the son of Ali(a.s.)<br />
O the love of Fatimah(s.a.)<br />
O the love of Fatimah(s.a.)</p>

<p>Ya ghareeb e karbala(O the lonely one of Karbala)..(5)</p>

<p>Savior of humanity<br />
Axis of equality<br />
Source of spirituality<br />
Symbol of purity<br />
O hussain you are the will of God<br />
Strike on brutality<br />
Ya ghareeb e karbala(O the lonely one of Karbala)..(5)</p>

<p>O the love of Almighty<br />
Victim of brutality<br />
To revive morality<br />
sacrificed your family<br />
By the side of flowing river..(2)<br />
O Hussain you died thirsty<br />
Ya ghareeb e karbala(O the lonely one of Karbala)..(5)</p>

<p>Your blood spilled in opression<br />
your kids faced aggression<br />
O Hussain you stood for love<br />
O Hussain you stood for peace<br />
O Hussain you spread justice<br />
O the ship of salvation<br />
Ya ghareeb e karbala(O the lonely one of Karbala)..(5)</p>

<p>Ya hussain, ya hussain Mazloom..</p>
</p>
     
